{"t":"015760.KS","n":"Korea Electric Power Corporation","nKo":"한국전력공사","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":25400.0,"chg":550.0,"chgPct":0.02213,"prev":24850.0,"dayH":25900.0,"dayL":25000.0,"w52H":69500.0,"w52L":24200.0,"vol":1299467,"avgVol":2117474,"mcap":16305888428032,"pe":null,"fpe":3.17,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":1542.0,"divY":0.0621,"beta":0.81,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Utilities","sKo":"유용","i":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","iKo":"유틸리티 - 규제 전기","city":"Naju-Si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.kepco.co.kr","sum":"Korea Electric Power Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the generation, transmission, and distribution of electricity in South Korea and internationally. The company operates through five segments: Electricity Sales, Nuclear Power Generation, Thermal Power Generation, Power Support, and Other. It builds and operates overhead and underground transmission power grids; offers digital substations, grid stabilization equipment, and predictive diagnostic system; high voltage direct current transmission; distribution network construction, distributed energy, and smart distribution network; power outage prevention, insulated sticks, and scheduled power shutdowns; and smart metering service. The company also engages in electricity sale and demand management; electric vehicle ch","sumKo":"한국전력공사는 자회사들과 함께 한국 및 해외에서 전력의 생산, 송전, 배전을 담당하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 전력 판매, 원자력 발전, 화력 발전, 전력 지원 및 기타 등 5개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 머리 위 및 지하 송전 전력망을 구축하고 운영합니다. 디지털 변전소, 그리드 안정화 장비 및 예측 진단 시스템을 제공합니다. 고전압 직류 전송; 배전망 구축, 분산에너지, 스마트 배전망; 정전 예방, 절연 스틱 및 예약된 전원 차단; 그리고 스마트 미터링 서비스. 회사는 또한 전력 판매 및 수요 관리에도 참여하고 있습니다. 전기차 채널"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":68952000000000,"ni":-24466853000000},{"y":2023,"rev":88205084000000,"ni":-4761522000000},{"y":2024,"rev":94001328000000,"ni":3748355000000},{"y":2025,"rev":97434472000000,"ni":8616963000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":23687966000000,"ni":1396387000000